<node id="Principal Component Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Principal Component Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">PCA is a linear dimensionality reduction technique that computes eigenvectors of the data covariance matrix to identify orthogonal axes (principal components) maximizing variance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b7bb64c7c77afa990b98fea6bfe6daa</data>
  <data key="d4">GA-Unit-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1793742849</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="t-Distributed Stochastic Neighbor Embedding">
  <data key="d0">t-Distributed Stochastic Neighbor Embedding</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">t-SNE is a non-linear algorithm that converts Euclidean distances between high-dimensional data points into conditional probabilities, minimizing the Kullback-Leibler (KL) divergence between high-dimensional and low-dimensional probability distributions.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b7bb64c7c77afa990b98fea6bfe6daa</data>
  <data key="d4">GA-Unit-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1793742849</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Uniform Manifold Approximation and Projection">
  <data key="d0">Uniform Manifold Approximation and Projection</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">UMAP is a non-linear manifold learning technique built on Riemannian geometry and algebraic topology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b7bb64c7c77afa990b98fea6bfe6daa</data>
  <data key="d4">GA-Unit-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1793742849</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Latent Space Interpolation Trajectories">
  <data key="d0">Latent Space Interpolation Trajectories</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Latent Space Interpolation Trajectories involves linearly or spherically interpolating between two random latent vectors 𝑧1, 𝑧2 ∼𝒩(0, I) to verify smooth and continuous output transformations through the decoder/generator.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b7bb64c7c77afa990b98fea6bfe6daa</data>
  <data key="d4">GA-Unit-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1793742849</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Real vs. Synthetic Feature Distribution Overlays">
  <data key="d0">Real vs. Synthetic Feature Distribution Overlays</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Real vs. Synthetic Feature Distribution Overlays involves plotting overlapping feature histograms comparing real dataset samples against generated synthetic samples to evaluate distribution match.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6b7bb64c7c77afa990b98fea6bfe6daa</data>
  <data key="d4">GA-Unit-1.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1793742849</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
