  <data key="d3">chunk-5f962918487ef320fd45d2de09dceac4</data>
  <data key="d2">3D Transposed Convolutions are used to expand the temporal dimensions for multi-bar generation.</data>
  <data key="d1">UNKNOWN</data>
  <data key="d4">GA-Unit-4.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1793742989</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
<node id="Human-in-the-Loop Interaction">
  <data key="d0">Human-in-the-Loop Interaction</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5f962918487ef320fd45d2de09dceac4</data>
  <data key="d2">Composers can fix specific instrument tracks and use MuseGAN's discriminator/generator for human-in-the-loop synthesis.</data>
